<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT-ICA a long-term buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-ICA a long-term buy.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokerage Abaco-Rodman said Thursday it altered its rating on Mexican construction firm Empresas ICA to long-term buy from buy.</p>
<p>&quot;We believe the market has already discounted the growth expected in the construction industry for 1997 and the following years. Therefore, we expect only lateral movements in the stock price in the short term,&quot; Abaco-Rodman analysts said in a report.</p>
<p>((-- Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7287902))</p>
